<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse suspends Csopak - traders.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse suspends Csopak - traders.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange suspended trading in shares of Csopak for the rest of the day, following too rapid an intraday rise, traders told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Traders said the suspension followed a major deal struck for 70,000 Csopak shares at 2,500 forints. On Tuesday Csopak closed at 1,900 forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
